    <mxCell id="c34" value="&lt;b&gt;Evidence (Anthropic Economic Index, Claude.ai, 13–20 Nov 2025):&lt;/b&gt; ranked #5 of 336 work tasks · success rate 94% (95% CI 93–95%) · 66% of conversations are work use · estimated speedup about 3.7×.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key:&lt;/b&gt; red = human checkpoint · blue = AI step · yellow = current pain point · green = pilot measurement. No reply is sent without a human review." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="615" width="1280" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
